### Phase 4 — Food + Feign through the Gateway

### Public menu (no JWT)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/food/hotels/1/menu

### Place order (CUSTOMER token, booking must be CONFIRMED)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/food/orders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": 1,
  "bookingId": 1,
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "items": [
    { "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### My orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/food/orders/my
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Admin update status
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/food/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PREPARING"
}

### Admin hotel orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/food/hotel/1/orders
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN

### Customer creating menu — expect 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/food/menu
Authorization: Bearer CUSTOMER_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": 1,
  "name": "Should Fail",
  "price": 10
}
